{"4087690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nilawanti: A Cursed Story", "steam_appid": 4087690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are Rudra, an explorer brave enough to enter an ancient cursed castle deep in the Western Ghats.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This was once a place of royal beauty. Now it is a place of death, silence, and whispers in the dark. A forgotten woman’s spirit still roams here — Nilawanti.<br>Solve puzzles, find lost relics, and uncover the truth behind her curse in this <strong>MYSTERY–HORROR ADVENTURE</strong> inspired by dark Indian legends. Local people still whisper about this place… and warn others never to go near it.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/0d254f77422377d54b4a0657aaf99a1a.poster.avif?t=1769322558\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/0d254f77422377d54b4a0657aaf99a1a.webm?t=1769322558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/0d254f77422377d54b4a0657aaf99a1a.mp4?t=1769322558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Cursed Castle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, a royal family lived here. They were obsessed with dark rituals and the secret of living forever. When Nilawanti entered the castle, something went terribly wrong. One night, screams filled the halls… and by morning, the entire family was gone.<br><br>Now the castle stands empty — but not truly empty. The air feels heavy. The walls seem to breathe. Footsteps echo even when no one is there. And something watches you from the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/f511e3ac7e7eefe2b2cb4c53d4ec0ea7.poster.avif?t=1769322558\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/f511e3ac7e7eefe2b2cb4c53d4ec0ea7.webm?t=1769322558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/f511e3ac7e7eefe2b2cb4c53d4ec0ea7.mp4?t=1769322558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nilawanti</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nilawanti was once human. A ritual trapped her soul inside the castle. Now she is angry, lost, and searching for the sacred scripture known as the <i>Granth.</i><br><br>She appears in mirrors behind you. She whispers your name in the dark. Doors close on their own. Cold breath touches your neck when no one is near.<br>She does not want you here.<br><br>To escape, you must face her — and learn the truth of the night that cursed this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Investigation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <strong>Rudra</strong>, you are not just exploring — you are walking into a nightmare.<br>Search for ancient writings, solve disturbing puzzles, and survive the supernatural force protecting Nilawanti’s secret.<br><br>Every object you collect brings you closer to the final ritual.<br>Every sound you make may bring her closer to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Explore dark rooms, hidden passages, and silent halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/4a06fe3aea1fff2d32aa20f98bb47961.poster.avif?t=1769322558\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/4a06fe3aea1fff2d32aa20f98bb47961.webm?t=1769322558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/4a06fe3aea1fff2d32aa20f98bb47961.mp4?t=1769322558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Solve puzzles to reach the sacred <i>Granth.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/253892af5d132558a53f28df4a46c464.poster.avif?t=1769322558\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/253892af5d132558a53f28df4a46c464.webm?t=1769322558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/253892af5d132558a53f28df4a46c464.mp4?t=1769322558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Hide from Nilawanti — stay quiet, control your breath, and do not run unless you must.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/ae277c9177cbe03fb9c762bcb2b70e9a.poster.avif?t=1769322558\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/ae277c9177cbe03fb9c762bcb2b70e9a.webm?t=1769322558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/ae277c9177cbe03fb9c762bcb2b70e9a.mp4?t=1769322558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Discover the truth behind her curse… and the terrible price of setting her free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/553cbff2902eabfd15912ddcff3a3aac.poster.avif?t=1769322558\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/553cbff2902eabfd15912ddcff3a3aac.webm?t=1769322558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/553cbff2902eabfd15912ddcff3a3aac.mp4?t=1769322558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nilawanti: A Cursed Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slow, story-focused horror experience based on tragedy, dark rituals, and Indian folklore.<br>In this castle, you are never alone.<br>The question is… will you escape — or will your soul stay here forever?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are Rudra, an explorer brave enough to enter an ancient cursed castle deep in the Western Ghats.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This was once a place of royal beauty. Now it is a place of death, silence, and whispers in the dark. A forgotten woman’s spirit still roams here — Nilawanti.<br>Solve puzzles, find lost relics, and uncover the truth behind her curse in this <strong>MYSTERY–HORROR ADVENTURE</strong> inspired by dark Indian legends. Local people still whisper about this place… and warn others never to go near it.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/0d254f77422377d54b4a0657aaf99a1a.poster.avif?t=1769322558\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.